1_setup_mixer.sh

Installs the MiXeR Singularity container and downloads the LD reference files.



1.1_setup_add_jaccard.sh

Patches the MiXeR code to also report the Jaccard index alongside the Dice coefficient.



mixer_uni.sh

Fits the univariate model to each trait, in 20 replicates.



mixer_bi.sh

Runs the bivariate model on every personality-IQ and every trait-height pair.



mixer_bi_2.sh

Runs the bivariate model on the remaining pairs, the Big Five against each other.



collate_personality_results.sh

Combines the replicates and makes the Venn diagrams and QQ plots.



analyze_mixer_results.R

Converts the combined output into SNP counts and overlap summaries.


figures.ipynb

Reference notebook from the MiXeR authors showing how their plotting functions work.

mixer_plot.R

Create final Venn diagram plots for paper.
